  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-post-disaster-reconstruction:\n\n- Provides post-disaster reconstruction monitoring using multi-temporal high-resolution imagery.\n- Classifies each pixel into five categories: non_building, unchanged, destroyed, under_construction, rebuilt.\n- Calculates and outputs recovery progress for each destroyed pixel.\n- Supports both synthetic (offline) and real (GeoTIFF input) data modes.\n- Outputs include classification and progress GeoTIFFs, parameters, and a run manifest.\n- Processes data locally and maintains user privacy\u2014no network required in synthetic mode.",
